#instructions
  .container
    .overview
      h3 Whats in the Kit?
      ul
        li
          a href="/" title="cli" Nitro CLI
          |  - our CLI tool for managing your project's infrastructure and services

    .installs
      .apple
        h3 Mac OS X
        ol
          li Download and run the Nitrous.IO Command Line Interface (CLI) Installer Package for OS X.
          li In Terminal, type nitro login and enter your Nitrous.IO username and password.

      .windows
        h3 Windows

      .linux
        h3 Debian/Ubuntu

        ol
          li
            | Add the ______ repository key to your local keychain.
            pre
              code sudo apt-key adv --recv-keys --keyserver keyserver.ubuntu.com 6B19EAE0

            p Then, add the ______ repository to your apt-sources list.
            pre
              code echo "deb https://get.nitrous.io nitrous main" | sudo tee /etc/apt/sources.list.d/nitrous.list

          li
            | Update and install the Nitrous.IO Command Line Interface (CLI)
            pre
              code sudo apt-get update
            pre
              code sudo apt-get install -yq nitro

          li Type nitro login and enter your username and password.

